---

Agent core
  nanobot — https://github.com/Abyss-c0re/nanobot
  Our embeddable C agent (peer/MCP/tools/OpenAI-compatible client).
  Grokium host wires a desktop TUI around nanobot; desktop UX stays in host/.
  nanobot remains buildable for ARMv7 / static / lean embedded targets.
  See NANOBOT_PIN.txt and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.

Inspiration / interface compatibility (not a source dump)
  Public agent UX patterns (slash commands, model config keys) are reimplemented
  in original C for Grokium. We do not ship xAI binaries, logos, or a vendored
  copy of Grok Build as our product runtime.
  Optional session import may read user-local ~/.grok/sessions when present;
  that data remains the user's; Grokium does not relicense it.

Optional runtime components (host-provided, not always bundled)
  See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES (llama.cpp, nanobot, system libs).
